  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A triangular shaped wire carrying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> current is placed in a uniform magnetic field of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math>, as shown in figure. The magnetic force on segment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> is (Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>).</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c420c4ea-3208-4430-b2b5-1b827c2628be-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 568px; height: 137px;\" /></p>",
